pan><span>Valid until 27 Sep 2026</span></div></div><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div id=\"page\" class=\"about-offer-content\"><div id=\"menuleftcontent\" class=\"menu-left-content\"><ul id=\"menu\"><li class=\"active ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">About the offer</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined ng-star-inserted\">chevron_right</span><!----></a></li><!----><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms &amp; Conditions</span><!----><!----></a></li><!----><!----></ul></div><div class=\"right-content\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offer-rte\">\n<div id=\"#abouttheoffer\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>About the offer</h2>\n<span class=\"expire-note\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span>Valid until\n27 Sep 2026</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>There’s more to celebrate this National Day!</p>\n<p><strong>Earn 50% Bonus Miles</strong> when you convert your mokafaa points into AlFursan Miles, and enjoy Reward Tickets to your favorite destinations, along with exclusive discounts, offers, and benefits.</p>\n<p>Celebrate every Mile that takes you closer to experiences and memories that last For Life.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"#validity\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>Offer validity  </h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>The offer is valid from 20 to 27 September 2026.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"#termsandconditions\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<ul class=\"my-custom-list\">\n    <li>The offer is valid from 20 to 27 September 2026.</li>\n    <li>All Bonus AlFursan Miles will be credited to your AlFursan account instantly after the transfer.</li>\n    <li>The minimum transfer from Mokafaa points to AlFursan Miles is 10,000 Mokafaa points per transaction.</li>\n    <li>Members must correctly enter their AlFursan membership number through the Mokafaa section of the Alrajhi Bank app, where the \"Transfer to Airlines\" feature can be accessed.</li>\n    <li>Bonus AlFursan Miles will be calculated per transaction and not on the cumulative total of AlFursan Miles converted from Mokafaa points during the campaign period.</li>\n    <li>The conversion of Mokafaa points to AlFursan Miles is subject to the conversion ratio and the program terms and conditions set by Mokafaa and AlFursan.</li>\n    <li>Once AlFursan Miles are credited to your AlFursan account after converting your Mokafaa points into AlFursan Miles, the transaction cannot be reversed.</li>\n    <li>Terms and conditions specific to Mokafaa apply.</li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/alfursan\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and conditions</a> specific to AlFursan Program apply.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}